# headwear/cloth/conical: the Conical straw hat (OUTER, P2b wave 2; the Jade coast's and the rice fields'): a wide shallow cone
# of woven straw (cloth3: straw whatever the person wears) with radial weave lines, the brim's near edge curving low over
# the brow; 20 px across, so the LOCO atlas stays inside B10's 128 KB. Seen from the high camera it is the same cone from
# every side (the light stays top-left). Mask: the 20 px brim.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear conical
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4

